DESCRIPTION:A Unique Songwriter in the Round Experience Join Bay Area sing
 er-songwriters and Supernova Support founders\, Karen Joy Brown and Katie 
 Phillips\, along with Briget Boyle and Joni Davis for an afternoon of orig
 inal songs that beautifully sing the unsayable and unapologetically confro
 nt internal and external obstacles to personal and artistic freedom. This 
 “All Songs Considered” style performance and discussion explores the s
 tories and creative process behind the song that will leave listeners feel
 ing inspired and empowered to incite their own creative revolution.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
