BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Returning to the First Mark with Catherine Cruz - November 7th —
  Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, California
DTSTART:20261107T000000
DTEND:20261108T000000
UID:b24cf8c2cda9a8626fbad83f261f0506@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Returning to the First Mark with Catherine Cruz - November 7th
 \n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $130.00\n        \n      \n    \
 n  \n\nReturning to the First Mark November 7th\, 2026 - 11:00am-3:00pm At
 tendance Price: $130.00 Ages 16+In this new workshop we will explore drawi
 ng and abstract mark making through play\, curiosity\, and child-like wond
 er.Before we learned to write words\, we communicated through marks. As ch
 ildren\, we drew with curiosity\, freedom\, and a sense of play - without 
 worrying about getting it "right” and without fear of getting our hands 
 dirty.  We played in the dirt and we made things.  This workshop invites
  you to reconnect with that creative spirit through abstract mark making a
 nd intuitive drawing.Using a variety of drawing tools and materials\, we'l
 l explore line\, texture\, rhythm\, and gesture as a personal visual langu
 age. Through guided exercises and playful experimentation\, you'll discove
 r how letting go of expectations can open the door to greater creativity a
 nd self-expression.Whether you're an experienced artist or simply curious 
 about abstract drawing\, you'll leave with new techniques\, greater confid
 ence\, and a renewed sense of creative freedom. No drawing experience is n
 ecessary - just a willingness to explore. Returning to the first mark mea
 ns:→ reconnecting with curiosity→ slowing down and truly seeing→ dis
 covering the language within ordinary things→ responding intuitively→ 
 building something personal through lines and marksParticipant must bring 
 the following:Note: There is no need to buy expensive materials\, please c
 onsider what you already have.  If you’re missing something\, let the i
 nstructor know\, Sebastopol Center for the Arts has a minimal amount of th
 ese supplies available to borrow.Apron or clothing you don't mind getting 
 paint onBlack gesso or black acrylic paintSpray bottle with water Acrylic 
 paint: two or three earthy colors such as burnt umber\, raw sienna\, or ye
 llow ochre.  If you don’t have these specific colors\, no need to purch
 ase them\, just bring whatever you haveA small container\, like a glass ja
 r\, to pour the gesso inA variety of paint brushes (3 to 5) from very thin
  to thickA container for waterDifferent types of paper to draw on\, from s
 mall to large sheets.  Examples: recycled book pages\, copy paper\, drawi
 ng pad\, newsprint\, brown paper bags\, vintage papers with or without ill
 ustrations but nothing too dark or too busy. Two black pens or markers wi
 th different tipsGlue stickScissorsPaper towelsThe class will begin with a
  talk and a demonstration\, so please plan to arrive early to allow time t
 o settle in.A short lunch break will be held from 12:30 to 1:00 PM. Kindly
  bring your own lunch and beverage.About the instructor: Catherine Cruz is
  a French-American artist whose work is informed by textures and patterns 
 created by the passing of time and the effects of the natural elements on 
 the built environment. She holds a Bachelor of Science in interior design 
 and she worked in the field of architectural design and green building cer
 tification for over 25 years. She has taught collage and mixed media works
 hops in the Bay Area and in France since 2019\, and this is her fifth year
  at the Sebastopol Center for the Arts. Her studio is located in Sebastopo
 l and she participates in Art Trails Open Studios. You may contact Catheri
 ne at beyouartstudio@gmail.com. Check out Catherine’s other classes here
 : https://wwws.sebarts.org/visual-arts-classes.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n            \n         
      \n                Add to cart
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
URL:https://www.sebarts.org/classes-lectures/returning-to-the-first-mark-w
 ith-catherine-cruz-november-7th
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
